    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 After subsection 45(6)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-1-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nRestraining orders and charges relating to unexplained wealth\norders\n\n(6A) If:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00006\n\nSchedule 1  Unexplained wealth\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Unexplained Wealth and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 6, 2015\n\n(a) a *restraining order referred to in paragraph 179SA(1)(b)\nwould otherwise cease to be in force under this section at a\nparticular time; but\n\n(b) a charge on the property against which the restraining order\nwas made is created by subsection 179SA(1) before that\ntime;\nthen despite anything in subsection (1), (2), (3) or (6) of this\nsection, the restraining order does not cease to be in force until the\ncharge ceases to have effect in respect of the property in\naccordance with subsection 179SA(2).\nSection does not apply to unexplained wealth restraining orders",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nRestraining orders and charges relating to unexplained wealth\norders\n\n(6A) If:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00006\n\nSchedule 1  Unexplained wealth\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Unexplained Wealth and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 6, 2015\n\n(a) a *restraining order referred to in paragraph 179SA(1)(b)\nwould otherwise cease to be in force under this section at a\nparticular time; but\n\n(b) a charge on the property against which the restraining order\nwas made is created by subsection 179SA(1) before that\ntime;\nthen despite anything in subsection (1), (2), (3) or (6) of this\nsection, the restraining order does not cease to be in force until the\ncharge ceases to have effect in respect of the property in\naccordance with subsection 179SA(2).\nSection does not apply to unexplained wealth restraining orders",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "791edd61d9857153c6ec150f8b9b20feb92bac4ee6040606fa304fa0c5fe8901",
      "skos:note": "Restraining order does not cease to be in force until the charge ceases to have effect."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015#sch-1-sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 After subsection 45(6)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nRestraining orders and charges relating to unexplained wealth\norders\n\n(6A) If:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00006\n\nSchedule 1  Unexplained wealth\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Unexplained Wealth and Other\nMeasures) Act 2015\nNo. 6, 2015\n\n(a) a *restraining order referred to in paragraph 179SA(1)(b)\nwould otherwise cease to be in force under this section at a\nparticular time; but\n\n(b) a charge on the property against which the restraining order\nwas made is created by subsection 179SA(1) before that\ntime;\nthen despite anything in subsection (1), (2), (3) or (6) of this\nsection, the restraining order does not cease to be in force until the\ncharge ceases to have effect in respect of the property in\naccordance with subsection 179SA(2).\nSection does not apply to unexplained wealth restraining orders"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-unexplained-wealth-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-7-norm",
