      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The report must be given as soon as practicable after a report under section 67 of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979 is laid before a House of Parliament.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The system recognizes the need for the report to be given as soon as practicable after reports under section 67 of the Australian Federal Police Act 1979 are laid before Houses of Parliament."
    },
